codex
The first focused proof exposed a genuine residual at loop exit: the semantics knows the guard is false, but the simplifier does not split “equal” from “greater” to relate the returned equality to the recursive predicate. I’m adding one guarded derived lemma expressing that exact integer trichotomy; it does not alter or skip program execution.
apply patch
