codex
The bridge compiled but did not preempt the ordinary `#while` step, so fixed semantics kept unrolling. I’m giving this already-proved exact bridge the semantics’ established preemption priority; the proof obligation remains the separate bridge-free theorem, not the priority annotation.
apply patch
