+
+## Exact commands and actual outputs
+
+The complete reproducible command is:
+
+```bash
+./prove.sh > prove.log 2>&1
+```
+
+Actual exit: `0`.
+
+`prove.sh` contains the exact translator, LLVM, Haskell, `krun`, `kprove`,
